$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=uhdv  LOC_AFTER=?

* The derivative of the sum of a holomorphic term-function sequence with summable majorants for the terms and their derivatives is the sum of the derivatives ( ~ ulmdv ). This is the derivative half of Mathlib's ` differentiableOn_tsum_of_summable_norm `.

